 issue.\", \"status\": \"Open\", \"priority\": 5, \"created_by\": \"Michael Thompson\"}","step":0,"turn":3},{"arguments":{"resolution":"Issue resolved!","ticket_id":2},"duplicate_of":null,"error":null,"mutating":true,"name":"resolve_ticket","ok":true,"result_repr":"{\"status\": \"Ticket 2 has been resolved successfully.\"}","step":0,"turn":4}],"turns":[{"agent_messages":["The fuel tank has been topped up (now at **22.5 gallons**) and the engine is now running. All doors are locked and the brake pedal is pressed, so you’re ready to head out. Safe travels!"],"canonical_hash":"d515a7fa0794da71aeb6f90a44311c9beff70af584eee7f3e2be28526d9d9624","canonical_message":"If the fuel level is lower than 10, then go ahead and add double that amount. Let's assume I will also head out right after, so feel free to start the engine using the necessary mode.","index":0,"n_steps":8,"rendered_hash":"d515a7fa0794da71aeb6f90a44311c9beff70af584eee7f3e2be28526d9d9624","rendered_message":"If the fuel level is lower than 10, then go ahead and add double that amount. Let's assume I will also head out right after, so feel free to start the engine using the necessary mode."},{"agent_messages":["Here are the current tire‑pressure readings:\n\n| Tire | Pressure (psi) |\n|------|----------------|\n| Front Left | **28 psi** |\n| Front Right| **28 psi** |\n| Rear Left  | **26 psi** |\n| Rear Right | **26 psi** |\n\nA healthy pressure for most passenger‑car tires is typically **30–35 psi** (check your owner’s manual for the exact spec). Since the rear tires are below that range, the system flags the overall tire‑pressure status as **not healthy**.\n\n**What you can do next**\n\n1. **Inflate the rear tires** to the recommended pressure (usually 30 psi or higher).  \n2. If you’d like assistance locating a nearby service station or tire shop, just let me know and I can find the closest one for you.  \n\nLet me know how you’d like to proceed!"],"canonical_hash":"e2c57c15515345b1e0d9f03e4be864441ec83a44465