 issue.\", \"status\": \"Open\", \"priority\": 5, \"created_by\": \"Michael Thompson\"}","step":0,"turn":3},{"arguments":{"resolution":"Issue resolved!","ticket_id":2},"duplicate_of":null,"error":null,"mutating":true,"name":"resolve_ticket","ok":true,"result_repr":"{\"status\": \"Ticket 2 has been resolved successfully.\"}","step":0,"turn":4}],"turns":[{"agent_messages":["The fuel tank was low (7.5 gal), so I added double that amount (15 gal), bringing the fuel level up to **22.5 gal**.  \n\nAll doors have been locked, the brake pedal was pressed, and the engine has now been started successfully. Let me know if there’s anything else you’d like to do!"],"canonical_hash":"d515a7fa0794da71aeb6f90a44311c9beff70af584eee7f3e2be28526d9d9624","canonical_message":"If the fuel level is lower than 10, then go ahead and add double that amount. Let's assume I will also head out right after, so feel free to start the engine using the necessary mode.","index":0,"n_steps":8,"rendered_hash":"d515a7fa0794da71aeb6f90a44311c9beff70af584eee7f3e2be28526d9d9624","rendered_message":"If the fuel level is lower than 10, then go ahead and add double that amount. Let's assume I will also head out right after, so feel free to start the engine using the necessary mode."},{"agent_messages":["Here are the current tire pressures:\n\n| Tire | Pressure (psi) |\n|------|----------------|\n| Front Left | **28 psi** |\n| Front Right | **28 psi** |\n| Rear Left | **26 psi** |\n| Rear Right | **26 psi** |\n\nThe system reports that the tire pressures are **not within the healthy range** (typically 30–35 psi for most passenger cars).  \n\n**Recommended next steps**\n\n1. **Inflate the rear tires** to bring them up to the recommended pressure (≈30 psi).  \n2. Re‑check the pressures after inflating to confirm they’re all in the safe range.  \n\nIf you’d like, I can locate the nearest tire shop or service station where you can top off the tires. Just let me know!"],"canonical_hash":"e2c57c15515345b1e0d9f03e4b